  "solution": "Given equation: 48 A 12 A 24 A 3 A 8 A 5 A 4\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) -, +, ×, =, ÷, +**\n\nGiven: 48 A 12 A 24 A 3 A 8 A 5 A 4\n\nAfter replacing the A signs we get;\n\n⇒ 48 - 12 + __**24 × 3**__ = __**8 ÷ 5**__ + 4\n\n⇒ __48 - 12__ + 72 = __1.6____** + 4**__\n\n⇒ __**36 + 72**__ = 5.6\n\n⇒ 108 ≠ 5.6 (False)\n\nOption 2) +, -, ÷, ×, =, +\n\nGiven: 48 A 12 A 24 A 3 A 8 A 5 A 4\n\nAfter replacing the A signs we get;\n\n⇒ 48 + 12 - __**24 ÷ 3**__ × 8 = __**5 + 4**__\n\n⇒ 48 + 12 - **__8 __**__**× **____**8**__ = 9\n\n⇒ __**60**____** - **__**__64__** = 9\n\n⇒ - 4 ≠ 9 (False)\n\nOption 3) -, +, ÷, =, ×, +\n\nGiven: 48 A 12 A 24 A 3 A 8 A 5 A 4\n\nAfter replacing the A signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**48 - 12**__ + __**24 ÷ 3**__ = __**8 × 5**__ + 4\n\n⇒ 48 - 12 + __24 ÷ 3__ = __40____** + 4**__\n\n⇒ __**48**__ - 12 __**+ 8**__ = 44\n\n⇒ __**56 - 12**__ = 44\n\n⇒ 44 = 44 (True)\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 4) -, +, ÷, ×, =, +\n\nGiven: 48 A 12 A 24 A 3 A 8 A 5 A 4\n\nAfter replacing the A signs we get;\n\n⇒ 48 - 12 + __**24 ÷ 3**__ × 8 = __**5 + 4**__\n\n⇒ 48 - 12 + __8____** × **____8__ = 9\n\n⇒ __48__ - 12 __**+ 64**__ = 9\n\n⇒ __**112 - 12**__ = 9\n\n⇒ 100 ≠ 9 (False)\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
